{"title":"Apocalyptic Chef Awakening","synopsis":"Shin Young-jun, seorang sersan koki, disambut oleh kiamat hanya beberapa hari sebelum liburan. Batalyon tersebut berubah menjadi kekacauan dalam sekejap, dan jaringan komunikasi terputus. Lalu sesuatu muncul di depan matanya! [Selamat atas kebangkitanmu!] [Pekerjaan: Koki Pemula Lv.1] Jika aku seorang pejuang atau pembunuh, aku akan mencoba untuk berdiri sendiri… Yang ditugaskan padanya adalah koki, yang jelas merupakan pekerjaan pendukung . Tidak ada yang bisa dilakukan jika sudah seperti ini. “Mulai sekarang, aku akan memberimu makan.”","alternative_title":"멸망한 세계의 취사병, Myeolmanghan Segyeui Chwisabyeong","author":"웨스트, 마일드커피","artist":"웨스트, 마일드커피","genres":["Action","Adventure"],"chapters":[{"id":"f402cf44-176e-4cf7-988b-d32adaf04dc3","number":"120","title":"Chapter 120","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"40a9d70d-2cab-4daa-a9ab-1cfeb1aa6890","number":"119","title":"Chapter 119","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"6afc1ffa-708f-4bf4-a98d-85f29f1ff64f","number":"118","title":"Chapter 118","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"216bb431-953f-4ccf-b52e-83c4564480dc","number":"117","title":"Chapter 117","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"00ccd9d7-549a-404a-ac27-6567e35786c7","number":"116","title":"Chapter 116","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"40d2b2b6-3e3e-4eec-bd9b-54b0438364c2","number":"115","title":"Chapter 115","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"8c9984e8-dfb6-4f6c-a306-3f36996249cb","number":"114","title":"Chapter 114","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"61d675fc-5b34-4ec7-beb8-2cac03f9f57d","number":"113","title":"Chapter 113","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"9b740ddb-4e44-44a6-8ddc-07cfb38f9f09","number":"112","title":"Chapter 112","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"62626971-9276-47c4-9f09-7ae585c5a8fd","number":"111","title":"Chapter 111","date":"2026-05-25","images":[]},{"id":"ce1c4b71-eafa-4a6c-9705-8145b7c04c3e","number":"110","title":"Chapter 110","date":"2026-05-